(7712355, 1267452, 141319, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The mono works, I think the colour would have worked as well. Just clever you used the tissue paper and the "compartments".  Well done and good luck.</td>', 'I really like this. The mono works, I think the colour would have worked as well. Just clever you used the tissue paper and the "compartments".  Well done and good luck.', '2022-01-21 14:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7712357, 1267600, 141319, '<td valign="top">People said they wanted more comments, so here goes :-).

<br/>I feel the box would either have to be properly skew or straight. But as it is the top line bothers me in this very "minimalist" type of set up. I also feel the pomegranate would work better on a more classical 1/3 composition in this shot (shift everything over to the left more). That is just me. I do like the minimalist and the way you played with shapes and used the shadow to highlight the fruit.</td>', 'People said they wanted more comments, so here goes :-).

I feel the box would either have to be properly skew or straight. But as it is the top line bothers me in this very "minimalist" type of set up. I also feel the pomegranate would work better on a more classical 1/3 composition in this shot (shift everything over to the left more). That is just me. I do like the minimalist and the way you played with shapes and used the shadow to highlight the fruit.', '2022-01-21 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7712358, 1267615, 141319, '<td valign="top">No wayyyy what a cute shot. How lucky was that? Or how  patient? :-). I don''t know if you could have toned down the light bulb a bit. It is what draws the eye the most.</td>', 'No wayyyy what a cute shot. How lucky was that? Or how  patient? :-). I don''t know if you could have toned down the light bulb a bit. It is what draws the eye the most.', '2022-01-21 14:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
