(7713127, 1267551, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love this, Gaby! Your dog is an absolutely gorgeous delight. And photographed to perfection. This was my equal top pick along with Wendy''s. Congrats on the blue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-01-29 16:35:01.</i></td>', 'I love this, Gaby! Your dog is an absolutely gorgeous delight. And photographed to perfection. This was my equal top pick along with Wendy''s. Congrats on the blue.', '2022-01-29 16:33:00.000000', '2022-01-29 16:35:01.000000', 0),
(7713128, 1267615, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous, Wendy! Such dedication to lie on your stomach in the cold for ages.  (When I do that even for a short time I get a nasty stitch that hangs around for ages.) How on earth do you get your squirrels to comply? Are they pretty much pets by now? This was my equal top pick along with Gaby''s.</td>', 'Fabulous, Wendy! Such dedication to lie on your stomach in the cold for ages.  (When I do that even for a short time I get a nasty stitch that hangs around for ages.) How on earth do you get your squirrels to comply? Are they pretty much pets by now? This was my equal top pick along with Gaby''s.', '2022-01-29 16:40:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7713129, 1267575, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very creative, Barbara, and very pleasing to the eye. This was my yellow ribbon pick. I''m glad the DQ got overturned.</td>', 'Very creative, Barbara, and very pleasing to the eye. This was my yellow ribbon pick. I''m glad the DQ got overturned.', '2022-01-29 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7713134, 1267551, 66597, '<td valign="top">Not sure who possibly gave this a 3, 4 or even a 5just a wonderful image, well-lit, with extreme cuteness to spare. Congratulations on a well-deserved blue!</td>', 'Not sure who possibly gave this a 3, 4 or even a 5just a wonderful image, well-lit, with extreme cuteness to spare. Congratulations on a well-deserved blue!', '2022-01-29 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7713136, 1267616, 97225, '<td valign="top">The day I looked at this I found an exposed but undeveloped roll of film in my drawer. Lost and found - but I wonder if it is worth the trouble and expense of getting it developed now. (I gave you 7.)</td>', 'The day I looked at this I found an exposed but undeveloped roll of film in my drawer. Lost and found - but I wonder if it is worth the trouble and expense of getting it developed now. (I gave you 7.)', '2022-01-29 19:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7713138, 1267615, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jomari:</b></div><hr/><i> Fabulous, Wendy! Such dedication to lie on your stomach in the cold for ages.  (When I do that even for a short time I get a nasty stitch that hangs around for ages.) How on earth do you get your squirrels to comply? Are they pretty much pets by now? This was my equal top pick along with Gaby''s. </i></td></tr></table>
<br/>
<br/>Naw  I havent tried to tame them. I keep thinking that I could, and it would make things easier. Right now I have to set something out and then wait for them to get used to it and get over the nervousness. Thats why I was laying on the floor for 45 minutes. That was actually a lot quicker than it usually is. Maybe because it was so close to dark, that they were in a hurry to be done?</td>', 'Originally posted by jomari: Fabulous, Wendy! Such dedication to lie on your stomach in the cold for ages.  (When I do that even for a short time I get a nasty stitch that hangs around for ages.) How on earth do you get your squirrels to comply? Are they pretty much pets by now? This was my equal top pick along with Gaby''s. 

Naw  I havent tried to tame them. I keep thinking that I could, and it would make things easier. Right now I have to set something out and then wait for them to get used to it and get over the nervousness. Thats why I was laying on the floor for 45 minutes. That was actually a lot quicker than it usually is. Maybe because it was so close to dark, that they were in a hurry to be done?', '2022-01-29 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
