<br/>(Just for the record (or the future) - the above refers to <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1418730" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Forum Thread regarding DQ</a>.)

<br/>I certainly liked the idea, and you did come up with a creative idea. Well deserved top 5 placement!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-01-30 13:16:29.</i></td>', 'What a back and forth - to me it was clear that it is a projection on real boxes, the shadows clearly show that. Well, good you had a proof in the "making-of"-shot.

(Just for the record (or the future) - the above refers to Forum Thread regarding DQ.)

I certainly liked the idea, and you did come up with a creative idea. Well deserved top 5 placement!', '2022-01-30 13:13:34.000000', '2022-01-30 13:16:29.000000', 0),
